# ecc39 -- (39,32) SECDED: dec(enc(d)) == d clean; every single flip corrected (ce); every double flip detected (ue)
# For all 2^32 data words: clean -> d, ce = 0, ue = 0; any one of the 39 stored bits flipped -> d, ce = 1, ue = 0; any two
# distinct bits flipped -> ue = 1, ce = 0. Combinational, full proof (drop 0.41); ecc39_fv.sv holds the harness. The syndrome
# is a parity over the codeword: ABC's BDD collapse settles the miter in about a second, plain abc pdr in 17 s, smtbmc yices
# not within 3 minutes (README.md).
[options]
mode prove
depth 1

[engines]
abc collapse -r; muxes; strash; pdr

[script]
plugin -i slang
read_slang -DFORMAL --top ecc39_fv ecc39.sv ecc39_fv.sv
prep -top ecc39_fv

[files]
rtl/ecc39.sv
formal/ecc39_fv.sv
